1
00:00:00,910 --> 00:00:02,780
(Sheldon:)I didn't hog anything.

2
00:00:02,779 --> 00:00:06,109
(Sheldon:)Unlike you and that weird
lasagna with raisins in it.

3
00:00:06,115 --> 00:00:07,345
(Leonard:)You want some of this?

4
00:00:07,350 --> 00:00:08,850
(Leonard:)I'll give you some.
BERNADETTE: Hey!

5
00:00:08,851 --> 00:00:10,621
(Bernadette:)Sheldon, Leonard,
living room, right now!

6
00:00:16,758 --> 00:00:20,458
She said my name first;
that must kill you.

7
00:00:20,463 --> 00:00:22,663
BERNADETTE: I don't know
what you think you're doing,

8
00:00:22,665 --> 00:00:25,035
(Bernadette(off):)but this is a very difficult
time for my husband!

9
00:00:25,034 --> 00:00:27,834
(Bernadette(off):)We're eating the last food
his mother ever made,

10
00:00:27,837 --> 00:00:30,307
(Bernadette(off):)and you were gonna throw it
at each other like children?!

11
00:00:30,306 --> 00:00:32,506
(Bernadette(off):)Whatever it is you're
fighting about, put it aside,

12
00:00:32,508 --> 00:00:34,808
(Bernadette(off):)go back in there
and be a good friend to Howard

13
00:00:34,811 --> 00:00:37,481
(Bernadette(off):)or there's no dessert
for either of you!

14
00:00:39,681 --> 00:00:42,121
(Bernadette(off):)Look at me
when I'm talking to you!

15
00:00:42,118 --> 00:00:43,618
(Bernadette(off):)And don't think...

16
00:00:43,619 --> 00:00:47,889
(Howard:)You guys ever notice sometimes
Bernadette sounds like my mom?

17
00:00:47,890 --> 00:00:49,820
(Amy:)I don't hear it.
No, not at all.

18
00:00:56,965 --> 00:01:03,025
(all groaning quietly)

